# Triage investigation

Investigate {{ ticket_id }}{% if title %} — {{ title }}{% endif %} against both the codebase and **live production data**. Code says what *should* happen; logs, metrics and stored state say what *did* happen for the specific case in the ticket. Most real triage answers ("did X fire? why not, for this customer?") can only be settled with live data, so this flow treats that as a first-class phase, not an afterthought.

The full ticket — title, description, comment thread, and any screenshots — is embedded below. Read it first; you don't need to re-fetch it.

